  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Cut tomato into wedges. Place carrot, zucchini and tomato on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1a85bd0c12080033f8d/step-dc806500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat in a medium saucepan.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1a85bd0c12080033f8d/step-400d4610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 mins remaining, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook chickpeas until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add mild curry paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add cooking cream, the water (for the curry) and brown sugar. Reduce heat to low and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove from heat and stir through roast veggies. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1a85bd0c12080033f8d/step-11a8a320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide butter rice and chickpea korma curry between bowls to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1a85bd0c12080033f8d/step-dd6c2e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
